SUMMARY:22nd INEBRIA Conference 2026
DESCRIPTION:The International Network on Brief Interventions for Alcohol 
 and Other Drugs holds its 22nd conference at the Karolinum Centre in Pra
 gue\, Czech Republic from October 14 to 16\, 2026. The conference covers
  brief interventions for alcohol and other drug use across addiction med
 icine\, psychiatry\, and public health\, with capacity for about 150 par
 ticipants and no conference fee.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract submission opens
 : 2026-02-18\nAbstract submission deadline: 2026-04-29\n\nhttps://inebri
 a.net/prague-2026/
LOCATION:Prague\, CZ\, Karolinum Centre
URL:https://inebria.net/prague-2026/
